AI LOST AND FOUND MANAGEMENT SYSTEM
Version 1.0

Specifications:-

1. User Authentication and Profile Management
   - User registration and secure login.
   - User profile management with contact information.
   - Role-based access for users and administrators.

2. Lost and Found Item Reporting
   - Users can report lost or found items.
   - Upload item images and provide details such as name, category, location, date and description.
   - Users can update or delete their submitted reports.

3. AI-Based Image Matching
   - AI analyzes uploaded images of lost and found items.
   - Computer vision is used to identify visual similarities between items.
   - The system generates potential matches with confidence scores.

4. Smart Search and Matching
   - Search items using category, keywords, location and date.
   - AI combines image and text information to improve matching accuracy.
   - Display the most relevant potential matches first.

5. Notifications and Claim Management
   - Notify users when a potential match is detected.
   - Users can submit a claim for a matching item.
   - Claim status can be tracked through the system.
   - Administrators can verify and approve/reject claims.

6. Admin Dashboard and System Management
   - Admin can manage users, lost items and found items.
   - Admin can review reported items and verify claims.
   - Dashboard provides statistics and system activity.
   - Admin can monitor and manage the overall lost and found process.
